sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SDK as SDK (customer server)
    participant DJ as Django public API
    participant CA as cdp-api (attachment store)
    participant S3 as Attachments bucket
    participant W as Email worker
    participant SES

    Note over SDK: sha256 and size per file,<br/>message budget checked locally (Q16)
    SDK->>DJ: POST attachments/uploads {sha256, size, type} x N
    DJ->>CA: same, with team id
    CA->>CA: team on allowlist? (Q4)
    CA->>S3: HEAD team/{id}/{sha256} per file
    CA-->>SDK: present, or a PUT URL signed for that size and sha256 (Q12)
    SDK->>S3: PUT each missing file
    S3-->>SDK: 200, or refused if bytes don't match the signed sha256
    Note over SDK: send only after every upload succeeded (Q11)
    SDK->>DJ: POST send/email {attachments: [{sha256, filename}]}
    DJ->>CA: send with refs only, no bytes
    CA->>S3: HEAD each ref under the caller's team
    alt a file is missing, or the message is over 40 MB
        CA-->>SDK: 4xx attachment_not_uploaded or message_too_large, nothing queued
    else every file present
        CA-->>SDK: 202 queued
        W->>S3: GET files at send time (byte budget, Q19)
        W->>SES: SendEmail with the files
    end
    Note over S3: lifecycle expires every object 7 days after upload (Q13)
